<title>USA: McDermott stake raised by Soros Group.</title>
<headline>McDermott stake raised by Soros Group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by investor George Soros said Tuesday it has increased its stake in McDermott International Inc to 5,856,500 shares, or 10.66 percent, from 4,587,000 shares or 8.35 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought shares of the New Orleans company that builds power generation systems between April 8 and May 5 at $18.15 to $21.47 each.</p>
